%F A370325 Equals A001113*A201776 = 1/(1 + A068985).
%F A370325 Equals 1/(1 + Sum_{k>=0} (-1)^k/k!). - _Peter Luschny_, Feb 15 2024
%F A370325 From _Peter Bala_, Oct 29 2026: (Start)
%F A370325 Equals 1 + Sum_{n >= 1} (-1)^n/(s(n)*s(n+1)*(n+1)!), where s(n) = 1 + Sum_{k = 0..n} (-1)^k/k! (telescoping series).
%F A370325 Equals 1 + Sum_{n >= 1} (-1)^n * n!/(b(n)*b(n+1)), where b(n) = A236438(n).
%F A370325 Simple continued fraction expansion: [0; 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 4, 1, 1, 6, 1, 1, 8, ...](End)
